g><br>There are several special crossbows with unique effects, for example:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >one that improves your stats with every kill,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >one that shoots bombs and deals area damage,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and one with a chargeable ability that launches you explosively into the air.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each crossbow changes your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326690/extras/57df2d2d009a51ffd388be6cf497cff5.poster.avif?t=1783674205\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326690/extras/57df2d2d009a51ffd388be6cf497cff5.webm?t=1783674205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326690/extras/57df2d2d009a51ffd388be6cf497cff5.mp4?t=1783674205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stat System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alongside classic stats like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Health</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stamina</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Damage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speed</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >there are two important special stats:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grapple Length:</strong><br>How far your grappling hook can reach — one of the most important stats in the entire game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lives:</strong><br>Extra lives let you continue after death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration &amp; Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secret Caves:</strong><br>Many caves are locked. To open them, you must find hidden buttons in the environment — sometimes obvious, sometimes almost impossible to spot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Islands:</strong><br>Some islands can be picked up and moved — but not infinitely, or you would break the entire game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Goal &amp; Replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speedrun-Focused:</strong><br>After every run, your time is saved. Try to beat your own record!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play Your Way:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rush straight to the boss.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every cave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Max out your stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or hunt perfect runs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run feels different — depending on your choices, your skill, and your willingness to take risks.</p>", "short_description": "Grapple across floating islands, fight dangerous enemies, and hunt powerful loot. Master risky movement, upgrade your stats, and race to the top to defeat the boss as fast as possible. Every run is a new challenge.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, Italian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“I hate the chests exploding”<br />\r\n4 – Bad Friend<br />\r\n", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326690/082666c61a0619b2961a63a6d47af4a5e0b0fbae/header.jpg?t=1783674205", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326690/8c397e9f9c982ba14ebf9bf8a30593e47acf1a4f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783674205", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4326690/8c397e9f9c982ba14ebf9bf8a30593e47acf1a4f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783674205", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating sys